<br/>The realistic non-engineering gearset above is nearly identical to the engineering BiS with the exception of the obvious helm change. The other change you will need to make to your gearing is the swap from the Twitching Shadows cloak to Softwind Cape to maintain hit cap.<div class="clear"></div></div></div></div></div>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="body-armor">Body Armor for Survival Hunter DPS</h3>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="head-for-survival-hunter-dps">Head for Survival Hunter DPS</h4>For the helm slot you have two options. The first and better option is <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=59456/deadly-bio-optic-killshades">
<img alt="Deadly Bio-Optic Killshades" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gizmo_newgoggles.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Deadly Bio-Optic Killshades</span></a>, however this does assume you have engineering as one of your professions. If you do not have engineering then your next best option is <img alt="" class="no-border" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/guide/images/27798.png"/>
<a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62429/windhome-helm">
<img alt="Windhome Helm" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_mail_dungeonmail_c_04.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Windhome Helm</span></a>/<wbr/>
<img alt="" class="no-border" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/icons/horde.png"/>
<a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62409/snarling-helm">
<img alt="Snarling Helm" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_mail_dungeonmail_c_04.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Snarling Helm</span></a>.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Helm Enchant</b>: <a class="q7 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62369/arcanum-of-the-ramkahen">
<img alt="Arcanum of the Ramkahen" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_fire_masterofelements.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Arcanum of the Ramkahen</span></a>
