<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="shoulders-for-survival-hunter-dps">Shoulders for Survival Hunter DPS</h4>For the shoulders you ideally will want to aim for <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=60427/vicious-gladiators-chain-spaulders">
<img alt="Vicious Gladiator's Chain Spaulders" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_mail_pvphunter_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Vicious Gladiator's Chain Spaulders</span></a>. These shoulders can be obtained by competing in rated battlegrounds and/<wbr/>or arenas for <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=390/conquest-points">
<span>
<img alt="Conquest Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvpcurrency-conquest-horde.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Conquest Points</span></span></a>. On the flip side you can simply compete in regular open world PvP or normal battlegrounds for <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=1901/honor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Honor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvpcurrency-honor-horde.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Honor Points</span></span></a> and purchase <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=64712/bloodthirsty-gladiators-chain-spaulders">
<img alt="Bloodthirsty Gladiator's Chain Spaulders" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_mail_pvphunter_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bloodthirsty Gladiator's Chain Spaulders</span></a>.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Shoulder Enchant</b>: <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62346/greater-inscription-of-shattered-crystal">
<img alt="Greater Inscription of Shattered Crystal" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_gem_goldendraenite_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Greater Inscription of Shattered Crystal</span></a>
