<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="back-for-survival-hunter-dps">Back for Survival Hunter DPS</h4>For the cloak you have a few options depending on what your ultimate goal is. If you want to aim for the absolute best then you can try and either farm or purchase a <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=67134/dorys-finery">
<img alt="Dory's Finery" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_cataclysm_melee_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Dory's Finery</span></a>. If you want to go the cheaper route from heroics you can pick up <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56315/twitching-shadows">
<img alt="Twitching Shadows" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_cataclysm_melee_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Twitching Shadows</span></a> if you have engineering or <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62361/softwind-cape">
<img alt="Softwind Cape" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_cataclysm_melee_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Softwind Cape</span></a> if you are not an engineer.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Cloak Enchant</b>: <a class="q1 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=44457/enchant-cloak-major-agility">
<img alt="Enchant Cloak - Major Agility" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_enchantedscroll.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Cloak - Major Agility</span></a>
