<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="chest-for-survival-hunter-dps">Chest for Survival Hunter DPS</h4>For the chest you will want <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=60304/lightning-charged-tunic">
<img alt="Lightning-Charged Tunic" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_mail_raidhunter_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Lightning-Charged Tunic</span></a>. This piece of tier can be purchased with 2200 <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> and it should be your first purchase as the chest will be needed to upgrade to the 372 iLvl heroic version once you get into raids. <br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Chest Enchant</b>: <a class="q1 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=52779/enchant-chest-peerless-stats">
