<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="wrist-for-survival-hunter-dps">Wrist for Survival Hunter DPS</h4>For the wrist slot you really only have one good option. <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=63479/bracers-of-some-consequence">
