<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="waist-for-survival-hunter-dps">Waist for Survival Hunter DPS</h4>For the belt slot you will want to aim for the Leatherworking crafted <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56539/corded-viper-belt">
<img alt="Corded Viper Belt" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_mail_raidhunter_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Corded Viper Belt</span></a>. The stats on this belt are significantly better than any other options available and with a red gem socket that provides an additional +10 agility you will not want to pass this up. As the belt is a BoE crafted item you will want to acquire this as soon as possible.<div class="pad"></div>
