<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="legs-for-survival-hunter-dps">Legs for Survival Hunter DPS</h4>For the legs you have two solid options. If you want to go the absolute best option and have the gold to spare then you can purchase <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=67150/arrowsinger-legguards">
<img alt="Arrowsinger Legguards" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pant_mail_raidhunter_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Arrowsinger Legguards</span></a>. On the other hand if you want to go the more realistic and much cheaper route you can run <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=5396/lost-city-of-the-tolvir">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Lost City of the Tol'vir</span></a> for a pair of <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56386/balkars-waders">
<img alt="Balkar's Waders" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_mail_dungeonmail_c_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Balkar's Waders</span></a>.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Leg Armor:</b> <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56550/dragonscale-leg-armor">
<img alt="Dragonscale Leg Armor" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_monsterscales_14.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Dragonscale Leg Armor</span></a>
