<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="feet-for-survival-hunter-dps">Feet for Survival Hunter DPS</h4>For the boots you have two options. For the absolute best gearset you will want to purchase <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=58199/moccasins-of-verdurous-glooms">
<img alt="Moccasins of Verdurous Glooms" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_mail_raidhunter_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Moccasins of Verdurous Glooms</span></a>. With that said these do cost 1650 <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a>, and should only be purchased <b>after</b> you have purchased your tier chest. <br/>
<br/>If you decide to go with an easier and much more affordable gearset option then <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62385/treads-of-malorne">
<img alt="Treads of Malorne" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_mail_raidhunter_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Treads of Malorne</span></a> are definitely the better option as they only require being exalted with <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/faction=1158/guardians-of-hyjal">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Guardians of Hyjal</span></a>.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Feet Enchant</b>: <a class="q1 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=52781/enchant-boots-assassins-step">
<img alt="Enchant Boots - Assassin's Step" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_enchantedscroll.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Boots - Assassin's Step</span></a>
