<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="jewelry">Jewelry for Survival Hunter DPS</h3>
<div class="pad"></div>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="neck-for-survival-hunter-dps">Neck for Survival Hunter DPS</h4>For the neck slot you again have two choices. Once again the absolute best option will be an expensive open world BoE drop which is <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=67137/don-rodrigos-fabulous-necklace">
<img alt="Don Rodrigo's Fabulous Necklace" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_necklacea9.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Don Rodrigo's Fabulous Necklace</span></a>. The more realistic option is the jewelcrafted <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=52350/brazen-elementium-medallion">
<img alt="Brazen Elementium Medallion" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_50.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Brazen Elementium Medallion</span></a>, unfortunately this neck can also cost a fair bit of gold so if you are on a really tight budget then you can opt for the <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=57931/amulet-of-dull-dreaming">
<img alt="Amulet of Dull Dreaming" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_forestnecklace.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Amulet of Dull Dreaming</span></a>.<div class="pad"></div>
