<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="trinkets-for-survival-hunter-dps">Trinkets for Survival Hunter DPS</h4>For the two trinkets you will want to aim for <img alt="" class="no-border" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/guide/images/27798.png"/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62468/unsolvable-riddle">
<img alt="Unsolvable Riddle" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_stonetablet_11.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Unsolvable Riddle</span></a>/<wbr/>
<img alt="" class="no-border" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/icons/horde.png"/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62463/unsolvable-riddle">
<img alt="Unsolvable Riddle" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_stonetablet_11.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Unsolvable Riddle</span></a> and <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56328/key-to-the-endless-chamber">
<img alt="Key to the Endless Chamber" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_key_10.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Key to the Endless Chamber</span></a>. These two trinkets should be relatively easy to obtain.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62051/darkmoon-card-hurricane">
<img alt="Darkmoon Card: Hurricane" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_inscription_tarot_hurricanecard.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Darkmoon Card: Hurricane</span></a> is not actually a pre-bis trinket even though it may seem like a great option with so much agility, but it actually does sim worse. Also with the incredibly high cost that it will be during launch and the early weeks I highly suggest you save your gold for enchants, gems, and consumables.<div class="pad"></div>
