<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="weapons">Weapons for Survival Hunter DPS</h3>
<div class="pad"></div>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="melee-weapons-for-survival-hunter-dps">Melee Weapons for Survival Hunter DPS</h4>As a <span class="c3">Survival Hunter</span> in Cataclysm you will typically want to always use a 2h weapon and ignore 1h options. The primary and secondary stats you gain from using a 2h weapon will <b>always</b> be better than using two 1h weapons.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=55066/elementium-poleaxe">
<img alt="Elementium Poleaxe" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_polearm_2h_cataclysm_b_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Elementium Poleaxe</span></a> is the absolute best option, and should not be terribly expensive to get crafted.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=65168/rockslicer">
<img alt="Rockslicer" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_throwingaxe_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Rockslicer</span></a> is the more realistic 2h option for pre-raid. <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56325/bertos-staff">
<img alt="Berto's Staff" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_stave_2h_cataclysm_c_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Berto's Staff</span></a> follows closely behind, but considering it is an open world BoE drop you may as well just spend your gold on <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=55066/elementium-poleaxe">
<img alt="Elementium Poleaxe" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_polearm_2h_cataclysm_b_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Elementium Poleaxe</span></a> instead.<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Weapon Enchants</b>: <a class="q1 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=68134/enchant-2h-weapon-mighty-agility">
<img alt="Enchant 2H Weapon - Mighty Agility" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_enchantedscroll.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant 2H Weapon - Mighty Agility</span></a>
<div class="pad"></div>
<table class="grid max-width">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td data-background="c4" style="width: 10%; max-width: 100%;">
<b>Rank</b></td>
<td data-background="c4" style="width: 25%; max-width: 100%;">
<b>Item</b></td>
<td data-background="c4" style="width: 20%; max-width: 100%;">
<b>Sockets</b></td>
