<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="ranged-weapon-for-survival-hunter-dps">Ranged Weapon for Survival Hunter DPS</h4>Finally for the ranged weapon and most important gear slot as a Hunter. <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=59367/kickback-5000">
<img alt="Kickback 5000" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_weapon_rifle_44.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Kickback 5000</span></a> is the best option for a Survival Hunter for both absolute and realistic gearsets <b>except for trolls</b>.<br/>
<br/>As a Troll you will want to use <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56317/amber-messenger">
<img alt="Amber Messenger" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bow_1h_cataclysm_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Amber Messenger</span></a> to take advantage of the <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=26290/bow-specialization">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_weapon_bow_12.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bow Specialization</span></a> racial.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Scope</b>: <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=59594/gnomish-x-ray-scope">
<img alt="Gnomish X-Ray Scope" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_scopea.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Gnomish X-Ray Scope</span></a>
